# maple_clump_deep: the shaded depths of a bigleaf maple's canopy.
# The leaves in the canopy's shade (forest, 12), a broad scalloped dome laid
# behind the lit masses, so the gaps between them are leaves in shadow and
# only a few small holes of sky show through. The anchor, 0,0, is the
# middle of its underside. 40 wide, 30 tall.
